      "heading": "B — Audience & Scope",
      "learner_facing": false,
      "markdown": "## B — Audience & Scope\nTarget audience: first-time, never-licensed applicants seeking Utah regular Class D passenger-car driving privileges, using the Utah Driver Handbook 2026-2027 in English.\nReading level: plain-language handbook prose for new drivers with no prior licensing background; no specialist or commercial-driving vocabulary assumed.\nPrerequisites: none beyond ability to read handbook English and to gather identity, presence, and residency documents at a driver license office; driver education completion applies to younger first-time applicants per Section 4.\nScope boundary: this part covers regular Class D licensing path only; commercial classes and endorsements are context, not the learning target.",
